  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 99 ÷ 8 + 2 - 16 × 4 = 39\n\nOption 1) × and +\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷ 8**__ × 2 - 16 + 4 = 39\n\n⇒ __**12.375 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 16 + 4 = 39\n\n⇒ __**24.75**__ - 16__** + 4**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __28.75____ - 16__= 39\n\n⇒ 12.75 ≠ 39\n\n**Option 2) ÷ and +**\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 99 + __**8 ÷ 2 **__- 16 × 4 = 39\n\n⇒ 99 + 4 - __**16 × 4 **__= 39\n\n⇒ __**99 + 4**__ - 64 = 39\n\n⇒ __**103 **____**- 64 **__= 39\n\n⇒ 39 = 39\n\nOption 3) − and ×\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷ 8**__ + 2 × 16 - 4 = 39\n\n⇒ 12.375 + __**2 **____**×**____** 16**__ - 4 = 39\n\n⇒ __**12.375 + 32**__ - 4 = 39\n\n⇒ 4__**4.375**____** - 4**__ = 39\n\n⇒ 40.375 ≠ 39\n\nOption 4) ÷ and −\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 99 - 8 + __**2 ÷ 16**__ × 4 = 39\n\n⇒ 99 - 8 + __**0.125**____** × 4**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __**99**__ - 8 __**+ 0.5**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __**99.5**____** - 8**__ = 39\n\n⇒ 91.5 ≠ 39\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"÷ and +\".",
